{"date":null,"platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/ee/3c/36319_V88Na.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/ee/3c/36319_V88Na.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/ee/3c/36319_V88Na.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/ee/3c/36319_V88Na.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/ee/3c/36319_V88Na.jpg"},"summary":"鹬鸟和翠鸟在河边争夺一条大鱼。渔翁发现后，用鱼叉刺去，没有击中。鹬鸟趁机抢走大鱼，逃之夭夭。一只河蚌敞开胸怀在沙滩上晒太阳。翠鸟又啄到一条泥鳅，泥鳅挣扎滑落，正好掉在河蚌身上被夹住了，翠鸟想从河蚌壳里夺回泥鳅，鹬鸟又飞来赶走翠鸟，欲与河蚌争夺泥鳅。于是，鹬鸟与河蚌在沙滩上进行了一场智慧与心理的争斗。虽然泥鳅被鹬鸟吞下肚子，但是它的一条腿被河蚌夹伤了。双方都不肯善罢甘休，斗争又继续下去。鹬鸟佯装打盹，河蚌慢慢张开两壳，伺机进攻。鹬鸟出其不意猛然回头啄去，早有准备的河蚌立刻合拢，把鹬鸟的长喙死死夹住。这时，早已守候在芦苇中的渔翁趁机把它们一起捕获。","name":"鹬蚌相争","name_cn":"鹬蚌相争","tags":[{"name":"国产","count":88,"total_count":161065},{"name":"上海美术电影制片厂","count":72,"total_count":10570},{"name":"童年","count":52,"total_count":93111},{"name":"短片","count":49,"total_count":102408},{"name":"水墨","count":37,"total_count":1362},{"name":"1983","count":27,"total_count":1787},{"name":"剧场版","count":24,"total_count":725203},{"name":"上美","count":11,"total_count":647},{"name":"鹬蚌相争","count":10,"total_count":12},{"name":"胡进庆","count":8,"total_count":53},{"name":"国产动画","count":7,"total_count":5627},{"name":"顾汉昌","count":7,"total_count":19},{"name":"原创","count":5,"total_count":620730},{"name":"墨犊","count":5,"total_count":7},{"name":"中国","count":5,"total_count":31746},{"name":"动画电影","count":3,"total_count":43838},{"name":"1980s","count":2,"total_count":1093},{"name":"美术片","count":2,"total_count":59},{"name":"童年系列","count":2,"total_count":661},{"name":"1983年","count":2,"total_count":82},{"name":"吴云初","count":2,"total_count":4},{"name":"动画","count":2,"total_count":35732},{"name":"小说改","count":2,"total_count":159920},{"name":"华语","count":1,"total_count":162},{"name":"耿康","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"Short_film","count":1,"total_count":433},{"name":"非日本","count":1,"total_count":173},{"name":"史书衍生","count":1,"total_count":4},{"name":"映画","count":1,"total_count":6306},{"n